IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-ORCH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-REQUESTS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 UNIQUE-ADAPTERS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BASE-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 AGGREGATE-TOKS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LORA-ORCH.
    IF UNIQUE-ADAPTERS == 0 OR BASE-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 7400 TO AGGREGATE-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-REQUESTS.
    WEIGHT 30 AGGREGATE-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
